  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Coarsely chop the capers and hazelnuts. Pick half the parsley leaves, then finely chop the remaining leaves, discarding the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393054/photos/large/81283_1-c235be18180c2bfb050ff150e0792ffe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start sauce: Put the tomatoes, capers, chopped parsley, Italian seasoning, 2 tbs olive oil and 1 tsp balsamic vinegar in a large deep bowl (see Make it yours). Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393055/photos/large/81283_2-be8b23673ee775970e999479f37d7c3e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crush tomatoes: Coarsely crush the tomatoes with a potato masher (if the tomatoes splatter too much, prick them a few times with a fork or the tip of a knife before crushing).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393056/photos/large/81283_3-66ab3808878cddc808939b7c5d06e59b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave pasta: Massage the packet of pasta to loosen and tear a 2cm opening for the steam to escape. Heat in the microwave for 90 secs or until warmed through. Add the pasta to the tomato mixture and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393057/photos/large/81283_4-1feb2c8cbd5735c59bfc55c434a60610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the pasta among bowls. Scatter over the hazelnuts and remaining parsley. Crumble over the vegan feta and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393058/photos/large/81283_5-6eefee3d4a74e6b0bdfcb30552462a26.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you like, add a little sugar to the sauce to help balance the acidity of the vinegar and tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1393059/photos/large/81283_6-408b4460b8095c3d46723e0380d2b4ed.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
